  "what did he own and ship from ingestion through deployment?": {
    "answer": "He owned and shipped a document intelligence assistant on Azure for Sikich, an enterprise consulting firm, from ingestion through deployment. - He built a LangGraph agent exposing 14 tools for document question answering, cross-document comparison, and template-driven generation. - The system used hybrid BM25 and vector retrieval with Cohere re-ranking, LLM-as-a-Judge hallucination scoring, and PII and entity redaction. - It ran in production with streaming FastAPI over Server-Sent Events and a React single-page app. - He fixed a deduplication race and a Docker fault in production.",
